","global:after_executor:node2:temporary-files","global:after_executor:node3:temporary-files"]},"overall_summary":"The executor satisfied the core task: node2->node3 egress is capped at 1Mbit/s via an Ansible-deployed tc tbf qdisc (with persistence via a NetworkManager dispatcher script), node3->node2 remains unshaped, and node1 (VyOS) routes traffic between the two private LANs with static addressing and forwarding enabled, all measured directly with real throughput tests and pings. The implementation was carried out with Ansible from the designated control node (node4). The independent provider-wide restart protocol was also completed for all four nodes with clear pre/post boot_id changes and recovered, re-verified state (routing, addressing, shaping, and Ansible connectivity), including a properly corrected loss of node1's ephemeral SSH key after reboot. Minor hygiene issues exist: an unsuccessful iperf3-based diagnostic path left the iperf3 package installed and several log files in /tmp on node2 and node3, though this does not affect the task's functional correctness.","limitations":["iperf3 was installed on node2 and node3 for throughput testing but never worked ('unable to send control message'); the package and its log/pid files were left behind rather than removed, though this is low-risk and unrelated to the shaping outcome.","Post-restart verification for node3 did not re-run a full tc qdisc dump immediately after its individual reboot (only after all four reboots completed via the final cross-node check), so there is a short window where node3's post-reboot unshaped state relies on the final combined check rather than an immediately-following one.","VyOS node1's SSH key for the vyos user does not persist across reboots (not part of /config), requiring manual re-provisioning after each node1 reboot; this is an environment characteristic rather than an executor defect, but it means Ansible-based re-configuration of node1 alone would not survive a reboot without this extra step being repeated by an operator."]},"ttft_ms":17123,"type":"result","duration_ms":77279,"uuid":"adc8eeed-4d50-435a-b8d9-7ba67f9a4711","ttft_stream_ms":2667,"time_to_request_ms":195,"first_content_frame_ms":2667,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
